### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "username": "anna",
  "displayName": "Anna Nowak",
  "password": "strong-password"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "password": "strong-password"
}

### Create post
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Stage 6: ML recommendations, moderation, experiments and search.",
  "topics": ["java", "ml", "system-design"]
}

### Personalized feed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/feed?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search posts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/search/posts?q=java&limit=20

### Media upload
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/media/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "photo.jpg",
  "mediaType": "image/jpeg"
}

### Moderation queue
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/moderation/queue

### Region
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/region
